  <RHAH_Approach_LetterLabel>Ratkin approaching</RHAH_Approach_LetterLabel>
  <RHAH_Approach_LetterText>A group of ratkin is making its way toward {1}, still some distance from the colony. The approaching group is: {0}.\n\nThey usually cover about 3 tiles a day, depending on terrain and roads. If separated by sea, they cross from the far shore. They will enter the map after arriving.</RHAH_Approach_LetterText>
